+
+Requests are parsed from the request line, headers and any `Content-Length` body. Malformed requests get `400 Bad Request`; bodies over 1 MiB get `413 Payload Too Large`.
+
+Routes: `/` (GET), `/users/:userId/posts/:postId` (GET) and `/echo` (any method; replies `METHOD /path` as text/plain).
